def GlobalDocumentation {
  code Intro =[{..
  -------------------------------------------------------------------
  NOTE: This file is automatically generated by running llvm-tblgen
  -gen-kit-intrinsics-doc. Do not edit this file by hand!!
  -------------------------------------------------------------------

=========================
LLVM Intrinsics Reference
=========================
.. contents::
  :local:

.. |br| raw:: html

  <br/>

These are Kitsune-specific intrinsic functions that have been added to LLVM.
These are nearly always added by a :ref:`tapir target <glossary-tapir-target>`,
but may also be added by Kitsune's drivers. In most cases, these are lowered to
a call to one of Kitsune's runtime functions.

If the name of an intrinsic starts with `llvm.kit.async`, the intrinsic will
always be :ref:`non-blocking <glossary-non-blocking-intrinsic>`. These will
always return before the operation to be performed has completed.
}];
}

include "llvm/IR/Intrinsics.td"
